{"version":"1.6.0-alpha.4","notes":"## 1.6.0-alpha.4 - 2026-10-31\n\n### Features\n\n- Show sending progress for each destination device and ask for confirmation before resending starts a new transfer (#2129)\n- Keep settings easy to use in narrow windows with a collapsible category drawer (#2126)\n- Use smaller image previews to reduce memory use when browsing clipboard history (#2145)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Allow browsing older and newer history entries with the mouse wheel or Page Up and Page Down even when all currently loaded entries fit in the window (#2150)\n- Show upgrade progress while the app is starting instead of leaving the main window hidden (#2149)\n- Keep syncing when closing a lightweight window or switching desktop modes, and respect the separate background startup setting (#2114)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.6.0-alpha.4 - 2026-10-31\n\n### Features\n\n- 显示向各台设备发送内容的进度，并在重新发送需要发起新传输时请求确认 (#2129)\n- 窄窗口下将设置分类收起为可展开的抽屉，让设置内容更易查看和操作 (#2126)\n- 浏览剪贴板历史时使用更小的图片预览，减少内存占用 (#2145)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 即使当前加载的历史记录全部显示在窗口内，也能通过鼠标滚轮或 Page Up、Page Down 浏览更早或更新的记录 (#2150)\n- 应用启动时显示升级进度，避免主窗口一直隐藏 (#2149)\n- 关闭轻量模式窗口或切换桌面模式时保持同步，并遵循独立的后台启动设置 (#2114)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-11-01T01:25:21Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.4/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.4_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.4/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.4_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.4/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.4_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.4/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.4_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.4/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.4/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}